{"id":12848,"date":"2025-11-27T11:58:03","date_gmt":"2025-11-27T11:58:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12848"},"modified":"2025-11-27T11:58:03","modified_gmt":"2025-11-27T11:58:03","slug":"webinar-zlepsete-recyklaci-polymeru-diky-ftir-analyze-a-reaktivni-extruzi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/webinar-zlepsete-recyklaci-polymeru-diky-ftir-analyze-a-reaktivni-extruzi\/","title":{"rendered":"Webin\u00e1\u0159: Zlep\u0161ete recyklaci polymer\u016f d\u00edky FTIR anal\u00fdze a reaktivn\u00ed extruzi"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"720\"><strong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"720\">Upcyklace polymer\u016f: Reaktivn\u00ed extruze a nov\u00e9 poznatky z FT-IR mikroskopie<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"985\">Rostouc\u00ed d\u016fraz na udr\u017eitelnost stav\u00ed do pop\u0159ed\u00ed modern\u00ed metody upcyklace plast\u016f. P\u0159esn\u011b tomu se bude v\u011bnovat odborn\u00fd webin\u00e1\u0159 zam\u011b\u0159en\u00fd na reaktivn\u00ed extruzi regranulovan\u00e9ho polypropylenu (rPP) a vyu\u017eit\u00ed kompatibiliz\u00e1tor\u016f pro zlep\u0161en\u00ed vlastnost\u00ed polymern\u00edch sm\u011bs\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1443\">\u00da\u010dastn\u00edci se sezn\u00e1m\u00ed s optimalizac\u00ed kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00fdch parametr\u016f extruze pomoc\u00ed metod statistick\u00e9ho pl\u00e1nov\u00e1n\u00ed experiment\u016f, s vyu\u017eit\u00edm reologick\u00fdch zkou\u0161ek k hodnocen\u00ed struktury a zpracovatelnosti polymer\u016f i s <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>pokro\u010dil\u00fdm FT-IR mikroskopick\u00fdm mapov\u00e1n\u00edm<\/strong><\/span>, kter\u00e9 pom\u00e1h\u00e1 odhalit chov\u00e1n\u00ed sm\u011bs\u00ed na mikroskopick\u00e9 \u00farovni. D\u016fle\u017eitou sou\u010d\u00e1st\u00ed je tak\u00e9 p\u0159edstaven\u00ed p\u0159\u00ednos\u016f kompatibiliz\u00e1tor\u016f, d\u00edky nim\u017e lze v\u00fdrazn\u011b zlep\u0161it mechanick\u00e9 vlastnosti nem\u00edsiteln\u00fdch polymern\u00edch syst\u00e9m\u016f.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_10587\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-10587\" style=\"width: 542px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-10587 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/02\/4c657fd9.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"542\" height=\"354\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/02\/4c657fd9.jpg 542w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/02\/4c657fd9-300x196.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 542px) 100vw, 542px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-10587\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">FT-IR mikroskop <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/ft-ir-mikroskop-raptir-2\/\">Nicolet RaptIR<\/a><\/strong> ve spojen\u00ed s FT-IR spektrometrem <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-is50\/\"><strong>Nicolet iS50<\/strong><\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1617\">\n<p data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1617\">Webin\u00e1\u0159 je ur\u010den v\u0161em, kdo se zab\u00fdvaj\u00ed pokro\u010dil\u00fdmi metodami recyklace, v\u00fdvojem udr\u017eiteln\u00fdch proces\u016f, zav\u00e1d\u011bn\u00edm cirkul\u00e1rn\u00edch technologi\u00ed nebo anal\u00fdzou polymern\u00edch materi\u00e1l\u016f a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.azom.com\/webinar.aspx?id=1073&amp;referrer=ThermoEmail&amp;tracksrc=Ext3P-AZO-Button1-2741352&amp;leadsource=Email&amp;C_Campaign_Element=701bV00000P4X8jQAF\">registrovat se na n\u011bj m\u016f\u017eete zde<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1707\"><strong data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1630\">Term\u00edn:<\/strong> \u010dtvrtek <strong data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1659\">4. prosince 2025<\/strong><br data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1662\" \/><strong data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1670\">\u010cas:<\/strong> <strong data-start=\"1671\" data-end=\"1705\">17:00\u201318:00 <\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"re